    {
      "id": "f3327f56-ecb9-4e36-a32a-6fe5c3633d17",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 43 · AI Price Monitoring\nEvery 4 hours checks product pages for prices, compares with your price and recommends adjustments.\n\n**Trigger:** schedule `0 */4 * * *`\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate."
      }
    }
  ],
